,"place_name_jianti_auto":"西河","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"8bf67698-db0e-11ef-bbd4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"8bf67699-db0e-11ef-8b6b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志：魏地，其界自高陵以東，盡河東、河內。高陵縣，漢屬馮翊，其地在河西，所謂「西河之外」者也。魏初使吳起守之，秦兵不敢東向。至惠王時，秦使衞鞅擊虜其將公子卬，遂獻西河之外於秦。吳，以國爲姓。相，息亮翻。守，式又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志：魏地，其界自高陵以东，尽河东、河内。高陵县，汉属冯翊，其地在河西，所谓「西河之外」者也。魏初使吴起守之，秦兵不敢东向。至惠王时，秦使衞鞅击虏其将公子卬，遂献西河之外于秦。吴，以国为姓。相，息亮翻。守，式又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":214,"tongjian_id":"8bf67685-db0e-11ef-a42e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8bf6769c-db0e-11ef-91bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"西門豹","people_name_jianti_auto":"西门豹","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8bf6769d-db0e-11ef-9c79-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"東門","people_name_jianti_auto":"东门","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8bf6769e-db0e-11ef-ba97-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"西郭","people_name_jianti_auto":"西郭","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8bf6769f-db0e-11ef-897f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"南宮","people_name_jianti_auto":"南宫","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8bf676a0-db0e-11ef-8e3a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"北郭","people_name_jianti_auto":"北郭","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8bf676a1-db0e-11ef-9328-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"西門","people_name_jianti_auto":"西门","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8bf676a2-db0e-11ef-87f8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鄴縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"邺县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8bf676a3-db0e-11ef-9162-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏郡","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8bf676a4-db0e-11ef-8c6b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄴","place_name_jianti_auto":"邺","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8bf676a5-db0e-11ef-82f1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志，鄴縣屬魏郡。西門豹爲鄴令，鑿渠以利民。王符潛夫論·姓氏篇曰：如有東門、西郭、南宮、北郭，皆因居以爲姓。西門蓋亦此類。鄴，魚怯翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志，邺县属魏郡。西门豹为邺令，凿渠以利民。王符潜夫论·姓氏篇曰：如有东门、西郭、南宫、北郭，皆因居以为姓。西门盖亦此类。邺，鱼怯翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":227,"tongjian_id":"8bf6769b-db0e-11ef-b6c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"屈","people_name_jianti_auto":"屈","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8bf676a9-db0e-11ef-b4ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"屈","people_name_jianti_auto":"屈","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8bf676aa-db0e-11ef-9617-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鮒","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲋","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8bf676ab-db0e-11ef-b7ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"屈侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"屈侯","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8bf676ac-db0e-11ef-9cce-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8bf676ad-db0e-11ef-aac5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8bf676ae-db0e-11ef-8ec7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8bf676af-db0e-11ef-aea9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"傅者，傅之以德義，因以爲官名。傅，芳遇翻。屈，九勿翻，姓也。余按屈，晉地，時屬魏；鮒蓋魏封屈侯也。鮒，音符遇翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"傅者，傅之以德义，因以为官名。傅，芳遇翻。屈，九勿翻，姓也。余按屈，晋地，时属魏；鲋盖魏封屈侯也。鲋，音符遇翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":265,"tongjian_id":"8bf676a8-db0e-11ef-abd5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"不勝爲負。","note_content_jianti_auto":"不胜为负。","note_type":"hu_note","start_